      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALWAYS CHANGIN (11) draws on the back row but came from this same barrier for third at this circuit and distance last time out. If things go his way he is up to winning this, as is THE BETTOR SIDE (5) who has been good from wider draws than this in two outings off a spell. Races well third-up so should be close to peaking and is better served by this barrier. SUN PUBLISHER NZ (7) turned in another strong performance last time when he battled on bravely at Pinjarra. Has to contend with a wider draw but had placed from similar barriers in his previous two outings at this circuit and distance. Can feature with even luck. ADMIRAL DARCY (3) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 2.8 metres from the winner in third at Northam. Should enjoy an economical run from this draw. Contender. ROCK ME OVER (6) backs up off a third in a Listed feature at Pinjarra on Monday. Can play a role again.",
